        },
        {
          "text": "Igicaniro car’ ikibazano; uburebure bg’igihagararo bgaco bgar’ amatambge atatu y’ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora, n’uburebure bg’ amakika bgar’ amatambge abiri; inkokora zaco no mu ntebe haco n’imbavu zaco, hose car’ ikibazano: maz’ arambarira, at’ Aya ni yo meza ar’ imbere y’Uhoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.22"
            ]
          }
