              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi hār’ amadirisha atugururwa n’ibigazi bishushanijwe ku rubaraza hirya no hino mu mpande zarwo; utwumba two mu mbavu z’ingoro, bo n’imbaho, uko ni ko vyari bimeze.",
